1341 «Как у Творца мы можем отключить адаптер, не удаляя его из включенных»: the Creator's right-click on an adapter's row (Mute / Unmute / Take it off), the muted row dimmed with its tag, out of the together-bar and its drag; Draw sends neither a muted adapter nor one at nought.
1342 (the page's side) a run whose painter streamed from RAM says how many of its blocks stayed on the card, and every run its card's peak.
1343 «детач лога сервера сделай вместе с GPU колонкой»: the log's window carries the cards beside the log; the dock folds as it opens and unfolds when it closes, if it was open.
1344 «зафиксировать прокрутку страницы, если vh имеет как минимум 920px»: the room fixed in a tall window, the form and the library scrolling on their own.
1345: Draw's row wraps and sticks at the form's foot above the folded log; Stop hidden at last when no run goes; the progress across the stage's top; the form's hints as the studio's i (the sampling's warning a ⚠); Sampling's fold kept; Seed wider, Variations narrower on one row; the picture fills the stage over its buttons, its data and prompt a tip beside it over the library on hover.

Kitchen suite green (suite-1341, 1343, 1344 parts; 1270's and 1340's checks fitted).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
